Q2.write a program to swap a number
  i)(No Third Variable) 
  code:
  a=2
  b=9
  print("before swapping: a = ",a," , b = ",b)

  a=a+b
  b=a-b
  a=a-b
  print("after swapping: a = ",a," , b = ",b)

  ii) (using Third Variable)
  code:
   a=2
   b=9
   print("before swapping: a = ",a," , b = ",b)

   c=a
   a=b
   b=c
   print("after swapping: a = ",a," , b = ",b)

